From 5b8c998a4fa96b211be5c27aafe47d1439308381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Miller <152090551+seelesturm@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:52:40 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mcp): configure the live client idle timeout

Keep the 300-second default. Let startup options disable idle expiry or set a longer window without changing hello deadlines or framing limits.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3940
